om/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Editor code looks fine to me.\n\nIt's a bit unfortunate to have web-specific code creeping in non-web files, but that's a precedent already with the Android editor, and we haven't found a good way to avoid these surgical changes without overcomplicating everything. The changes are still reasonable and the user experience for the web editor is improved greatly.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525#pullrequestreview-5290783702","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123525","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525#pullrequestreview-5290783702"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123525"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-23T12:13:32Z","commit_id":"1d528b5ab77b418d84455d3e78732e860a450254"},{"id":5294531202,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO5Qigg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected on Firefox 155 and Chromium 152 (Linux).\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- ZIP files created from folders in the FileSystem dock lack a top-level folder matching the original folder name. This mean it'll result in a zip-bomb if you extract the ZIP using 7-Zip's \"Extract here\" option:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"847\" height=\"299\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27faf41b-da57-4adc-939c-93916e767018\" />\r\n\r\n- As I mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123149#pullrequestreview-5281382356, I think the **Project > Pack Project as ZIP** option should be hidden in the web editor as it doesn't download the resulting ZIP. It's also funtionally identical to **Download Project Source**.\r\n  - Perhaps we should rename **Download Project Source** to **Pack Project as ZIP**, and use the new implementation on the web editor, so it's transparent to users. The only difference is that unlike the native **Pack Project as ZIP** option, you don't get to choose the file name for the ZIP here.\r\n\r\n- Unrelated, but we should also hide **Project > Setup Android Build...** as the web editor can't export to Android.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525#pullrequestreview-5294531202","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123525","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525#pullrequestreview-5294531202"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123525"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-23T17:39:26Z","commit_id":"1d528b5ab77b418d84455d3e78732e860a450254"},{"id":5306607971,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPExpYw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","i